        "Threshold: sets NPV = alpha(V_H - E[V]) with E[V] = 180 + 240q, solves to q* = 0.4375, verifies that the dilution at q* is exactly 30.0000, and gets the direction right: pooling above q*, separating below, and q = 0.60 lies above.",
